// Dev probe for the glTF mesh pipeline: the CC0 Khronos sample Avocado
// (content/models/avocado.glb), scaled up from its real-world ~6 cm so it
// reads next to unit-sized bodies. Spawned by the sandbox only — proves
// textured mesh loading/drawing end-to-end until real character assets land.
(
    components: {
        "Transform":  (scale: (25.0, 25.0, 25.0)),
        "RenderMesh": (asset: "content/models/avocado.glb"),
    },
)
